*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "0.1"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "OPENINK.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Open Inkjet"
*Product: "(Open Inkjet A4)"
*ModelName: "Open Inkjet A4"
*ShortNickName: "Open Inkjet A4"
*NickName: "Open Inkjet A4 (300 dpi mono, HP 45 compatible)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsModelNumber: 1
*% Direct PNG/PBM submission only: no PDF or cups-raster route yet, and job options (copies, orientation, resolution) are ignored.
*cupsFilter: "image/png 0 oi_filter"
*cupsFilter: "image/x-portable-bitmap 0 oi_filter"
*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*DefaultResolution: 300dpi
*Resolution 300dpi/300 dpi: "<</HWResolution[300 300]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize
*OpenUI *PageRegion/Page Region: PickOne
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion
*% ImageableArea uses a 4 mm border, a GUESS until measured on hardware (host/openinkjet/filter.py MARGIN_MM)
*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "11.3 11.3 583.7 830.7"
*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"
